# Path-only shortcuts. Cloudflare Pages serves these from the build output.
#
# Hostname matching (e.g. www.duc.work -> duc.work) is NOT supported here and
# was already tried and removed - see docs/decisions.md, 2026-09-16. That needs
# a Cloudflare Redirect Rule. A path like /gym is a different case and is the
# documented use of this file.
#
# 302, not 301: a permanent redirect is cached by browsers forever, so changing
# the destination later would mean clearing caches on every device.
/gym   https://bot.hc.tools/agents/tham-m-u/web/health/index.html   302
